This project vendors the answer-scoring logic from CORE-Bench.

    CORE-Bench: Fostering the Credibility of Published Research Through a
    Computational Reproducibility Agent Benchmark
    Zachary S. Siegel, Sayash Kapoor, Nitya Nadgir, Benedikt Stroebl,
    Arvind Narayanan.  arXiv:2409.11363
    https://github.com/siegelz/core-bench

CORE-Bench is distributed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2024 Zachary Siegel.
The vendored scoring function lives in src/repro_agent/scoring.py and preserves
the original interval-based grading semantics so that scores reported by this
project remain directly comparable to the published CORE-Bench leaderboard.
